# .dockerignore
#
# Purpose: Excludes host dependencies, build artifacts, secrets, Git metadata, and test outputs
# from the Docker build context sent to the daemon.
#
# Context: Prevents Windows/macOS native node_modules binaries (e.g., esbuild) and local .env
# files from leaking into Linux Alpine container layers.
#
# Implementation Specs: Retains scripts/shims/node-abort-controller (required by pnpm-workspace.yaml overrides)
# while ignoring node_modules, dist, coverage, .env, .git, and IDE folders.

node_modules
dist
coverage
.vitest
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
*.zip
test
docs
README.md
PHASE*-README.md
DOCKER-README.md
LICENSE
